    "matchedTitle": "Fragments of a Life Loved",
    "year": 2023,
    "genres": [
      "Documentary"
    ],
    "overview": "For over thirty years, between Paris and Rome, Chloé Barreau has been filming her love life. While in a relationship, she would already build its memory by filming, taking pictures, writing about it… but what do her exes remember? What is their side of the story? This film traces a woman's life, based exclusively on the interviews of people who loved her. Intimate testimonies and private items reveal the universal paths of the feeling of love.",
